    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Add Client additional external reference" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Client Additional External Reference</p>
            <p>Creates a new additional external reference for the selected individual client</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker-generated 16-char alphanumeric reference</p>
            <step>Load individual client from fixture and navigate to newest client menu</step>
            <step>Open “Additional External References” from the left menu</step>
            <step>Capture client_id from the URL</step>
            <step>Click Add, enter external reference, click Save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Record is saved and visible in the grid</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
